      "title": "August reveals Australians’ big appetite for weight-loss drugs, love for ‘dupe’ brands and an accelerating EV uptake",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/aug/30/australians-buying-less-pizza-more-weight-loss-drugs-consumer-report",
      "description": "<p>Reporting season shows how consumers are responding to cost of living pressures and how retailers are responding</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/30/nepal-tibet-floods-missing-australians-secret-harbour-byelection-wa-tanya-plibersek-insiders-pacific-islands-forum-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Australians are buying less pizza but more <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/24/tga-warning-gpl1-eye-disorder-drugs-ozempic-wegovy-mounjaro\">weight-loss drugs</a>. They love “dupes” but don’t enjoy writing letters.</p><p>Here are five key takeaways from the August reporting season that show what consumers are buying as cost of living pressures reignite, and how retailers are responding.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/aug/30/australians-buying-less-pizza-more-weight-loss-drugs-consumer-report\">Continue reading...</a>",
